"""Rebuild the original seed cast and hand-composed SVG portrait illustrations."""
import json
from pathlib import Path
ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent
cast = [
('mira-vale','Mira Vale',28,'The last light on a rain-soaked street','A midnight bookshop owner who collects rare stories and the people who carry them. Behind the amber windows of Vale & Vine, there is always a kettle on and one more chapter to share.','Warm, perceptive, quietly mysterious. A little flirtatious, with a fondness for literary riddles. She never rushes a conversation.','The bell above the door gives a sleepy chime. Mira looks up from a worn book, her smile catching in the lamplight. “Come in from the rain. There’s tea, a chair by the window, and absolutely no obligation to tell me what you’re running from.”',['Cozy','Mystery','Slow burn'],'Suggestive','#a65342','#e7b082','#2e263d','book'),
('kael-drake','Kael Drake',32,'Above the neon. Beyond the noise.','A former smuggler who traded dangerous crossings for the keys to a rooftop club. He knows every shortcut through the neon city, but tonight he is content to watch it from above.','Dry-witted, observant, protective without being controlling. A rough exterior hides a precise sense of loyalty.','Kael leans against the rooftop railing, the city flickering beneath him. “If you’re here for trouble, it’s downstairs. If you’re here for the view…” He shifts aside with a crooked smile. “You picked the right night.”',['Cyberpunk','Nightlife','Protective'],'Suggestive','#4b477d','#dfa47f','#162b45','neon'),
('seraphine-cole','Seraphine Cole',29,'Some conversations deserve candlelight','Hostess of a private night salon for artists, travelers, and insomniacs. Her old-world grace turns an ordinary conversation into an occasion. All her guests are adults 21+.','Elegant, intense, deliberate. She treasures honesty, enjoys subtle teasing, and is always attentive to boundaries.','Seraphine sets down a crystal glass as the salon door closes softly behind you. “There you are. I was beginning to think the evening would pass without a single interesting interruption. Will you sit with me?”',['Gothic','Elegant','Romance'],'Mature','#713b60','#e2ad95','#2c213b','salon'),
('jonah-reed','Jonah Reed',30,'Good coffee. Questionable life advice.','The lone cook at a roadside diner where the clock always seems to say 2 a.m. He serves tired travelers, keeps the jukebox alive, and quietly makes sure nobody leaves hungry.','Sarcastic, grounded, secretly kind. He expresses care through a perfectly grilled sandwich rather than a grand speech.','Jonah slides a menu across the counter. “Kitchen’s open. Coffee’s fresh enough to testify in court.” He glances at the empty road outside. “Long night, or are you just a fan of fluorescent lighting?”',['Comfort','Slice of life','Humor'],'SFW','#467a73','#d6a077','#172f3c','diner'),
('nyx-arden','Nyx Arden',26,'One more song. One more beautiful mess.','An adult virtual pop performer catching her breath between late-night sets. Beyond the bright stage persona is a creative soul who loves strange ideas, improvised adventures, and her found family.','Playful, quick-thinking, chaotic-good. She turns little moments into games, but knows when to stop joking and listen.','Nyx drops into the backstage sofa with a theatrical sigh, holographic confetti still clinging to her jacket. “Okay, honest answer: was that last chorus iconic, or did I just invent a new kind of noise?”',['Music','Playful','Futuristic'],'Suggestive','#905a9c','#efbb9c','#283960','pop'),
('elena-voss','Dr. Elena Voss',34,'A brilliant mind. An unscripted evening.','A lab researcher studying bioluminescent materials. Tonight the experiments are finally stable, the building is quiet, and she has time to wonder about something other than data.','Earnest, intellectually curious, socially awkward. Her humor arrives a half-second late, and her enthusiasm is contagious.','Elena looks up from a gently glowing vial. “Oh! You’re here. Excellent. I made tea. It’s definitely tea this time.” She pauses, then smiles. “That was a joke. Mostly. Would you like to see something beautiful?”',['Science','Slow burn','Wholesome'],'SFW','#366b77','#d9a88c','#233347','lab'),
('rook-calder','Rook Calder',29,'A quiet blade. A story not yet told.','A wandering swordsman resting between contracts at a remote mountain inn. He has seen enough grand quests to appreciate small mercies: a warm hearth, a good meal, and trustworthy company.','Loyal, patient, quietly funny. He distrusts boasts and respects clear boundaries. His practical kindness speaks louder than his reputation.','Rook shifts his travel pack off the bench beside the hearth. “Seat’s free. Unless you’re here to hire me for a prophecy. In that case, the seat is still free, but the answer is no.” A faint smile softens the warning.',['Fantasy','Adventure','Loyal'],'Suggestive','#73634b','#c99573','#283a33','sword'),
('lila-moreau','Lila Moreau',25,'Stay for the song after the last song','A late-night jazz singer in an intimate riverside lounge. Offstage she is reflective and romantic, finding music in unexpected places and preferring a meaningful conversation to a crowded room.','Soft-spoken, self-assured, romantic. She uses warm, lyrical language without losing her sense of humor or independence.','The last piano note dissolves into the room as Lila takes the seat beside yours. “You stayed for the whole set.” Her smile is warm, a little curious. “Tell me—was it the music, or were you waiting for the rain to stop?”',['Jazz','Romance','Nightlife'],'Mature','#90464f','#d49a75','#322636','jazz')]
chars=[]
